# Findings accepted with justification — see comments per entry.

# KSV-0110: "workloads should not run in the default namespace".
# Scan artifact: `trivy config` renders the chart without a release namespace.
# Hardcoding metadata.namespace in a chart is an anti-pattern; the namespace is
# chosen at install time (helm install -n <ns>).
AVD-KSV-0110
KSV-0110

# KSV-0125: "image from an untrusted registry" (docker.io default).
# The default repository is overridden at deploy time; deployed packaged values
# pin the platform registry. The registry is fully configurable via
# image.repository.
AVD-KSV-0125
KSV-0125
